patreon
pypi.org

# Currently commented out; kept as a reference in case we want to skip npm in the future.
# See: https://github.com/orgs/community/discussions/174098
# https://www.npmjs.com

# GitHub commit, issue, and PR links are occasionally unstable (502/403) or hit rate limits (429).
# These links are mostly generated in CHANGELOGs and do not need strict availability checks in CI.
git-cliff/commit/
https://github.com/.*/issues/.*
https://github.com/.*/pull/.*

